The median time of each program, in milliseconds, over {{rounds.pass1}} rounds in each of {{passes}} passes, and three ratios against the tree-walker. Under 1, that side took less time. A program counts as faster below 0.97, slower above 1.03, and level between, judged on the ratio before it is rounded for the table.

